# the master's polish, the EQ page's fourth knob (KNOB 4): on in a new project (POLISH_DEF, 40), turned by hand it moves a step
# a click, reaches 0 (off) and 127, goes out as CC 19 on the master's channel, a CC 19 sets it; saved with the project
wait 300
expect mst.polish 40
tap GLO
expect page Mix
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_EQ
wait 40
shot master_polish.png
ccreset
turn K4 1
wait 20
expect mst.polish 41
expect ccst 186
expect ccd1 19
spin K4 -200
expect mst.polish 0
spin K4 300
expect mst.polish 127
midi BA 13 20
wait 20
expect mst.polish 32
# saved with the project, back from its slot
mst polish 77
projsave 1 polish_test
mst polish 5
reboot
wait 400
expect mst.polish 77
# a new project starts with it on
tap HOME
tap SEL
row NEW PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
expect mst.polish 40
